DB_DATABASE=/app/db.sqlite3
</CODE>

### 3. Running the Application
To run the application, use the following command:
```bash
php -S 0.0.0.0:5000 -t public
```

### Summary
This implementation provides a simple API that accepts a zip file, extracts all text files from it, concatenates their contents, and returns the result as plain text. The application is configured to run on port 5000 and uses SQLite as the database.
